  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Four forces are acting at a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> in equilibrium as shown in figure. The ratio of force <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></math>_____ .</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/41b13e96-7400-4a90-9c49-a7858436269a-image.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 164px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4653be34-b37b-470c-b563-a31b6c03296f-image.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 180px;\" /></p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>Applying equilibrium conditions,</p><p>Taking components along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;&amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math></p><p>Considering right side positive,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8721;</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Taking&nbsp;upward positive,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8721;</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
